{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他重新面对那个决定，仍愿意坚持，因为它确实让他不再僵在犹豫里。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再僵在犹豫里\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"那些珍惜的东西如今难再拥有，他更不愿把曾感受过的温暖说成自我安慰。\",\n      \"key\": \"难再拥有\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那阵温暖让他舍不得放下亲近安稳的盼望，却也怕自己终究得不到。\",\n      \"key\": \"终究得不到\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想靠坚持让自己安心，却怕愿望落空，不敢停下，便反复追问还能怎么补、逼自己往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复追问\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他继续向前也不能单靠行动就过上想要的亲近、安稳日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近、安稳日子\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R14\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留决定曾使他走出停滞的实际作用，接回短暂松快退去后决定重现的时点，并指回先前不再等答案的选择。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不愿否认先前温暖的心理事实，改用珍惜之物难再拥有的处境解释他为何舍不得抹掉那份感受，也让感激与柔情有了来由。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"把温暖唤起的希望与落空之忧写清，再写他如何想靠坚持求安心，却因害怕面对不舍而反复追问、逼自己向前。分别补足记忆带来的刺痛、身体受迫感与思绪循环，并接回先前压住难过的经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动确有价值却不足以满足全部需要的判断，具体写出继续行动仍不能让他过上向往的亲近、安稳生活，为后来承认依恋留下依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5e6300d-b29e-4c39-a71f-0be4c1521dbf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T065501977024Z", "elapsed_seconds": 772.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T07:07:54.547778+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5f1844ac25778501d7349ac218f844be6d678002c2e310ae36650910d54ccffb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b9488